<title>UK: Banco Citibank sets $70 million three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Banco Citibank sets $70 million three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Citibank International Plc.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO CITIBANK S.A.</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  CITIBANK N.A.</p>
<p> AMT    $70 MLN	 COUPON     7.80	MATURITY    12.JUN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.866    PAY DATE    12.JUN.97</p>
<p> REOFFER    99.866    SPREAD	+150 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 10	  GOV LAW     NEW YORK</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5.875 PCT THREE-YEAR U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED UNDER $300 MLN GLOBAL MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
